      <li><strong>Cut Tomatoes</strong> – Crate near door (Hargrove's Mercantile)</li>
      <li><strong>Sugar Box</strong> – Counter (Reba's Diner)</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="perk-action">Mix at Reba's Diner soda machine.</div>
