</div><h1 id="wiki_relics">Relics</h1>
<p>The nine <strong>Relics</strong> modify gameplay in Cursed Mode. They are grouped by difficulty: <span class="relic-chip grim">Grim</span> (entry), <span class="relic-chip sinister">Sinister</span> (mid), <span class="relic-chip wicked">Wicked</span> (high). Slot combinations raise your Cursed Tier:</p>
<ul class="relic-tiers">
  <li><strong>Tier I</strong>: Any 3 <span class="relic-chip grim">Grim</span> — Unlocks Golden Armor (45,000 Essence)</li>
  <li><strong>Tier II</strong>: 2 <span class="relic-chip sinister">Sinister</span> + 2 <span class="relic-chip grim">Grim</span> (example loadout) — Unlocks Ultra Rarity (weapon upgrade cost scaling)</li>
  <li><strong>Tier III</strong>: 3 <span class="relic-chip grim">Grim</span> + 2 <span class="relic-chip sinister">Sinister</span> + 1 <span class="relic-chip wicked">Wicked</span> (example) — Unlocks Pack‑a‑Punch IV (100,000 Essence)</li>
</ul>
<p class="relic-note">You can mix other combinations; higher tier requirements demand total difficulty value equal to target tier fill (Grim≈1 • Sinister≈2 • Wicked≈3).</p>
<div class="relic-grid">
  <div class="relic-section">
    <h2 class="relic-heading grim">Grim Relics</h2>
    <div class="relic-cards">
      <div class="relic-card grim">
        <div class="relic-title">DRAGON WINGS <span class="mini-tag">Power-Ups disabled</span></div>
        <ol class="steps">
          <li>Reach Round 20</li>
          <li>Use Vandorn→Janus Jump Pad; shoot 3 purple rooftop symbols mid-air</li>
          <li>Start trial at Barn portal</li>
          <li>Survive 4 waves (Power-Ups hurt you)</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      <div class="relic-card grim">
        <div class="relic-title">LAWYER'S PEN <span class="mini-tag">Items may spawn as Shock Mimics</span></div>
        <ol class="steps">
          <li>Reach Round 20</li>
          <li>Ignite 3 red candles (Ruby Rabbit couch • Lost Cabin couch • Farmhouse bedside)</li>
          <li>Start trial at Barn portal</li>
          <li>Survive 4 waves with only Shock Mimics spawing</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      <div class="relic-card grim">
        <div class="relic-title">TEDDY BEAR <span class="mini-tag">Round delay −75%</span></div>
        <ol class="steps">
          <li>Find 10 Mister Peeks while using Aether Shroud</li>
          <li>Start Barn portal trial</li>
          <li>Survive waves (each shot costs 100 Essence)</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="relic-section">
    <h2 class="relic-heading sinister">Sinister Relics</h2>
    <div class="relic-cards">
      <div class="relic-card sinister">
        <div class="relic-title">VRIL SPHERE <span class="mini-tag">Max 4 perks</span></div>
        <ol class="steps">
          <li>Activate Cursed Tier I</li>
          <li>Reach Round 40; spawn Doppleghast; kill via Jump Pad</li>
          <li>Start launch pad portal trial (Zarya)</li>
          <li>Survive 5 waves (purchases disabled; 2 HVT waves)</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      <div class="relic-card sinister">
        <div class="relic-title">FOCUSING STONE <span class="mini-tag">No Self-Revives</span></div>
        <ol class="steps">
          <li>Activate Cursed Tier I</li>
          <li>Round 40: obtain 2 wine bottles (melee Zursa • T.E.D.D. Trial chest)</li>
          <li>Place & pattern-shoot bottles (Blackwater Cabin)</li>
          <li>Start Zarya launch portal trial (Essence wiped)</li>
          <li>Survive waves with zero Essence</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      <div class="relic-card sinister">
        <div class="relic-title">SAMANTHA'S DRAWING <span class="mini-tag">Every weapon swaps each round</span></div>
        <ol class="steps">
          <li>Activate Cursed Tier I</li>
          <li>Give to Chompy a weapon of each Rarity (Common/Grey, Uncommon/Green, Rare/Blue, Epic/Purple, Legendary/Orange)</li>
          <li>Reach Round 40 and give to Chompy either the Ray Gun or the Ray Gun Mark II</li>
          <li>Travel to Zarya Cosmodrome and interact with the yellow portal in front of the Exfil cabine near Yuri's Lab to start the Relic Trial</li>
          <li>Survive 5 waves of HVTs and zombies while all Max Ammo Power-Ups and Ammo Caches are disabled</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="relic-section">
    <h2 class="relic-heading wicked">Wicked Relics</h2>
    <div class="relic-cards">
      <div class="relic-card wicked">
        <div class="relic-title">BUS <span class="mini-tag">Enemy health regenerates</span></div>
        <ol class="steps">
          <li>Activate Cursed Tier II</li>
          <li>Reach Round 60; flawless round (no damage) → laugh cue</li>
          <li>Start boat house portal trial (Blackwater)</li>
          <li>Survive 6 waves (zombies only killable by other zombies; Brain Rot needed)</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      <div class="relic-card wicked">
        <div class="relic-title">DRAGON <span class="mini-tag">Ammo Crates disabled</span></div>
        <ol class="steps">
          <li>Activate Cursed Tier II</li>
          <li>Complete Main Quest at Round 60 & continue</li>
          <li>Start cabin portal trial (Blackwater)</li>
          <li>Survive 6 waves (damage only with explosives)</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      <div class="relic-card wicked">
        <div class="relic-title">BLOOD VIALS <span class="mini-tag">Augments off</span></div>
        <ol class="steps">
          <li>Activate Cursed Tier II</li>
          <li>Round 20: ringing red phone sequence (retry at 30 if fail)</li>
          <li>Start interior cabin portal trial (Blackwater)</li>
          <li>Survive 6 waves (−50% damage output)</li>
        </ol></div></div></div></div>

